---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Partner With Us" description="Partner with Culinary Travel Experts. We work with hotels, travel agents, DMCs, food tour operators, and corporate planners across Malaysia.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-brand-800 text-white py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-white max-w-2xl">Partner With Us</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/85 max-w-3xl">We only work with travel professionals. Hotels, DMCs, travel agents, food tour operators, corporate planners. If you send guests to Malaysia and they care about food, we are your local team.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">How It Works</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">Four steps to working together.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 1</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Introduce Yourself</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Send us a note. Tell us what you do, who your clients are, and what kind of food experiences you need in Malaysia.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 2</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Get the Trade Kit</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Sample itineraries, pricing structure, destination overviews, and partnership terms. Review at your own pace.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 3</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">First Proposal</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">When you have a client or group in mind, brief us. We come back with a detailed proposal within 48 hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 4</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Ongoing Relationship</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">After the first trip, you have a direct contact at CTE who knows your preferences. Future proposals get faster and more precise.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partner Types -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">Partner Types</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">Different buyers, different relationships.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <a href="/partner-with-us/hotels.html" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Hotels & Concierge</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Your guests want food recommendations beyond the hotel restaurant. We give your concierge team a programme they can book. White-label or co-branded.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/partner-with-us/agents.html" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Travel Agents & DMCs</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Pre-built and custom food modules you slot into any Malaysia itinerary. One contact, clear pricing.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/partner-with-us/organizers.html" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Food Organizers & Chefs</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">You bring the audience, the brand, the food perspective. We handle the local coordination: vendor relationships, transport, timing, permits.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/partner-with-us/corporate.html" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Corporate & Incentive</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Team cooking that involves actual cooking. Incentive trip food stops. Gala dinners with local menus for groups of 20 to 200.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-800 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold">Ready to start?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Request the trade kit or send us a brief. We respond within 24 hours.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/trade-kit.html" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
          Request Trade Kit
        </a>
        <a href="/contact.html" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-white/50 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Contact Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
